# Package manager: Bun

For this project, **do not use `npm`**, **`npx`**, or **`pnpm`** for installing dependencies or running package scripts.

- Use **`bun`** for installs: `bun install`, `bun add`, `bun add -d`, `bun remove`, etc.
- Use **`bun run`** (or **`bunx`**) instead of `npx` when executing local binaries or package scripts (e.g. `bun run build`, `bunx prettier --write .`).
- When suggesting commands to the user or running terminal commands in this workspace, default to Bun unless a tool explicitly requires another runner.

If `bun` is unavailable in an environment, say so and fall back only then.
